{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求助的晚禱"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩，交與伶長。用絲弦的樂器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"顯我為義的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼籲的時候，求你應允我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在困苦中，你曾使我寬廣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在求你憐恤我，聽我的禱告！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"你們這上流人哪，你們將我的尊榮變為羞辱要到幾時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們喜愛虛妄，尋找虛假，要到幾時呢？（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要知道，耶和華已經分別虔誠人歸他自己；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我求告耶和華，他必聽我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你們應當畏懼，不可犯罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在床上的時候，要心裏思想，並要肅靜。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當獻上公義的祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又當倚靠耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有許多人說：誰能指示我們甚麼好處？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你仰起臉來，光照我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使我心裏快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勝過那豐收五穀新酒的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我必安然躺下睡覺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為獨有你－耶和華使我安然居住。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}